{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05E2B0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你知道哥斯达黎加的国鸟吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不知道……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"哎呀？身为鸟类学家，连这个都不知道吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加的国鸟是土色鸫。一种在全国到处都能见到、不起眼的棕色鸟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"为什么选这种鸟当国鸟？不是还有凤尾绿咬鹃之类很多更鲜艳的鸟吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"土色鸫的叫声非常好听。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"而且我觉得，比起华丽的鸟，他们更愿意选一种所有国民都熟悉的鸟，这就是哥斯达黎加的民族性吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":135,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"果然<R=这里,COSTA RICA>的人不太有拉丁气质啊。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=这里,COSTA RICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"作为鸟类学家，我还挺高兴的。毕竟不是只有华丽的鸟才算鸟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"对了，而且凤尾绿咬鹃还是危地马拉的国鸟。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""}]}